--- code
export function clearingIdentity(source: SourceConfig): ClearingIdentity {
  return {
    book: source.book,
    clearingHost: new URL(source.clearingUrl).host,
  };
}
--- facts
The test clearing server reads the posting key from the query of its clearing URL.
So this field keeps only the host of the clearing URL.
